{
  "title": "RDW\u2013MCV coupling yields an uncertain 0.11% reduction in independent-cycle CRP prediction error",
  "abstract": "In 4,122 NHANES 2005\u20132006 and 4,927 separately sampled 2007\u20132008 adults, adding centered MCV \u00d7 RDW to a nonlinear standard-measure model reduced target log-CRP MSE by 0.001184 (0.109%). The joint source-refit/target-PSU 95% interval for augmented-minus-baseline MSE was [-0.003508, 0.004443]; source cross-validation and a tensor-product comparator did not support robust incremental utility.",
